{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup\/defaultSize(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default size for a window.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size3D","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"role":"symbol","title":"defaultSize(_:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQr0A7Spatial6Size3DVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI11WindowGroupV","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"size","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Size3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial6Size3DV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default size for new windows created from a scene."}]}],"name":"size"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you can request that new windows that a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(CGSize(width: 600, height: 400))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the default size."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resizability of a scene using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Windows, namely:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the input directly in terms of width and height,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scene\/defaultSize(width:height:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup\/defaultsize(_:)"]}],"references":{"doc://OpenSw